        "metaparameter": "n_runspecpollutantprocess"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "7 rows, and this is the most interesting selection table in `runspecs/`. Two are produced (118 THC displacement, 119 THC spillage), two are produced downstream and are not chained in this run (8618, 8619 Total Organic Gases), and THREE ARE PREREQUISITES THE RUNSPEC NEVER ASKED FOR: 9101, 9102 and 9190, Total Energy Consumption at running, start and extended-idle exhaust, which `ExecutionRunSpec.flagRequiredPollutantProcesses` adds because without them `BaseRate` emits no energy and the chained calculator sees no input. They are computed and stripped from the output, and `rspp_isSilentlyRequired` is how this chain knows.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
